{
  "meta": {
    "name": "River farm",
    "horizon": 480,
    "units": "1 tick = 1 minute; km; litres; hectares",
    "notes": [
      "A river splits the farm. The bridge (west-east) is the short crossing; the south road is a long detour.",
      "Jobs are submitted far-first and the most urgent job (J6) is submitted late, which hurts FCFS.",
      "T1 starts low on fuel. T2 breaks down mid-job at t=60; T1 is the only other sprayer.",
      "T3 is the only mower, so if it broke down, mowing jobs would be unassignable."
    ]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {"id": "depot",   "x": 1, "y": 5},
    {"id": "west",    "x": 3, "y": 5},
    {"id": "nw",      "x": 3, "y": 8},
    {"id": "sw",      "x": 3, "y": 2},
    {"id": "east",    "x": 6, "y": 5},
    {"id": "ne",      "x": 6, "y": 8},
    {"id": "se",      "x": 6, "y": 2},
    {"id": "far_e",   "x": 9, "y": 5},
    {"id": "far_ne",  "x": 9, "y": 8}
  ],
  "edges": [
    {"id": "depot_road", "a": "depot", "b": "west",   "length": 2},
